        "type": "reg",
        "input": "n = 3",
        "output": "5",
        "expectedOutput": "5",
        "explanation": "((())), (()()), (())(), ()(()), ()()() are the 5 well-formed strings"
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "n = 1",
        "output": "1",
        "expectedOutput": "1",
        "explanation": "only '()' is well-formed"
      },
      {
